{
    "title": "Coco's Spa & Salon",
    "description": "Calling aspiring designers! It's time to show off your skills in Coco's Spa and Salon. Have fun with makeup, hairstyling, nail spa and styling entire outfits for your chosen model. \r\n\r\nCoco's Spa and Salon is a makeover game with you as the stylist. Choose a model, apply facial makeover, hair styling and color their nails. Get your girls ready for the final photoshoot, make sure that your model looks better than ever, and dress them up in fancy outfits and accessories.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Fun and relaxing game\r\n- Choose from 4 different models and over 15 different hairstyles. \r\n- Numerous outfits and accessories to dress up your model\r\n- Have fun with numerous tools, including cheek brush, brow shaping tool, hairdryer, hair spray, nail clippers, lipsticks and more! \r\n- Makeup Salon - fix facial problems, eyebrow shaping and coloring, apply lipstick and more! \r\n- Hair Salon - apply shampoos, blow dry hair, choose a hairdo, apply coloring, put on accessories and more!\r\n- Nail Spa - use nail clippers, paint nails and put on sparkly accessories!\r\n- Dressup Studio - choose from numerous one-piece or two-piece outfits, high heels, put on jewellery and tiara!\r\n\r\nShowcase your creativity and bring those designs to life with this new app. Brought to you by 123 Kids Academy, creators of the award-winning toddler games for kids aged 2-7. Our educational games have been enjoyed by children and used in classrooms worldwide! Our goal is to promote learning through play to help kids develop practical learning skills.\r\n\r\nYour child's privacy and safety is our top priority. We will never share your personal information with 3rd parties or sell it.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Calling aspiring designers! It&#39;s time to show off your skills in Coco&#39;s Spa and Salon. Have fun with makeup, hairstyling, nail spa and styling entire outfits for your chosen model. <br><br>Coco&#39;s Spa and Salon is a makeover game with you as the stylist. Choose a model, apply facial makeover, hair styling and color their nails. Get your girls ready for the final photoshoot, make sure that your model looks better than ever, and dress them up in fancy outfits and accessories.<br><br>Features:<br>- Fun and relaxing game<br>- Choose from 4 different models and over 15 different hairstyles. <br>- Numerous outfits and accessories to dress up your model<br>- Have fun with numerous tools, including cheek brush, brow shaping tool, hairdryer, hair spray, nail clippers, lipsticks and more! <br>- Makeup Salon - fix facial problems, eyebrow shaping and coloring, apply lipstick and more! <br>- Hair Salon - apply shampoos, blow dry hair, choose a hairdo, apply coloring, put on accessories and more!<br>- Nail Spa - use nail clippers, paint nails and put on sparkly accessories!<br>- Dressup Studio - choose from numerous one-piece or two-piece outfits, high heels, put on jewellery and tiara!<br><br>Showcase your creativity and bring those designs to life with this new app. Brought to you by 123 Kids Academy, creators of the award-winning toddler games for kids aged 2-7. Our educational games have been enjoyed by children and used in classrooms worldwide! Our goal is to promote learning through play to help kids develop practical learning skills.<br><br>Your child&#39;s privacy and safety is our top priority. We will never share your personal information with 3rd parties or sell it.",
